<title>USA: RFS Hotel to buy 4 Sheraton hotels.</title>
<headline>RFS Hotel to buy 4 Sheraton hotels.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>RFS Hotel Investors Inc said on Monday it has agreed to acquire four full-service Sheraton hotels in California for $90 million.</p>
<p>Closing of the deal is expected in early January 1997, RFS said.</p>
<p>Three of the hotels are located in Silicon Valley and the fourth is in Bakersfield, the company said.</p>
<p>The seller of the hotels was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
